  unitName: Sea Fauna King Vaisal
  unitId: 21046
  unitNumber: 1679
  description: Called the king of all oceanic fauna, Vaisal was a descendant of the
    ancient sea gods and ruler of the ocean depths. Though he detested humans who
    showed disrespect toward the sea, Vaisal was also distant from the Holy Emperor's
    circle of deities. When the God Army invaded the Sama Kingdom, Vaisal was initially
    adamant in his refusal to interfere. However, he eventually granted aid to the
    Sama Navy after the firstborn prince of Sama slew a demon that had been plaguing
    the seas. Even knowing the overwhelming advantage the God Army held, the Sea
    Fauna King chose to share humanity's fate.
  summonDesc: I am the Sea Fauna King...<br>As the descendant of the great Marine
    Emperor, I am the wrath of the roaring seas made flesh!
  fusionDesc: Lend me your aid, human.<br>Know this...the king of all oceanic fauna
    leaves no debt unpaid!
